<title>Central African Republic: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/car/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-car-2026-11-11T22:53:08.679Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:53:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in Lake Chad, while the military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership. Sudanese Arab refugees fleeing to Chad near the CAR border are encountering hostility and distrust from local populations, and a man deported from Minnesota to CAR reports his life is at high risk. Misconduct has been reported at France’s embassy in the Central African Republic and the government has declared a planned fuel protest illegal. Sudan airstrikes are targeting border zones, adding pressure to the region. The conflict produced 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQY1pldmxNWi1fTzYzdXk5NlFWNDFmNGZTcDJkN0ROdmlOeTN4eEtlMlFhS0pWdzVKTzdyRGVSTkw5TFZmV2JHU20xajAxQkd4VHRXU0s4SmJ6ck9pcmRBZGFXcng5LW9aeHVqRzdiREZ6TGtoZ1lJeVhrYVNEZTNRS2dyZUZwcjBINzh5emVlb1BQcTUzVG5vNTViQXp6VjJTZ2dGTHY0NXg2TXR4LS1YUHNhbUhOanVtTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUmxJSTBtNC0zNWtPUkRhQ1JxS2dCRndtN3o1cURid3ZkdTRjTmthSmRubHJONFNBYlFLT1MwVGVyUENyNnYyYTU3Rnp5YjRSa3Z0NWprOWl6ckx4T3hXS3dGeThhZjlzWHFZSDNrX2VabUlaZWhKQUJORlJBYlFqNTJNYWRCaWcxLWhDTkxIRVl2Q2JvYlFVajdlN050dlI0?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNU0Y3N3dwVkdGV1BpRmwxQ0FIYmYxVlRabkE2VU96bEVLMVhGVG01VTd6VDdpWFM0bktUSTZJczFsX2pHWWZ6SjN3RUVBbGRwaGJJUWtOUUFWcW1CUVV6bzItdjNHVm0zUmJ5VEI4RVhDLUV2RFV4Z3d5NGphSER3cXFBTHg3RDV3Smg4c0tUTVFTUHg0X2paSmRORWk?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPNDhWcWFGLWc0WkFwTEJXNFBqZldCYlVVb3liQmJCSmNmX1dNVl9ITHBMeFAxTHMyN0daRTlKN